# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AI Agent Platform — Test Requests
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8100/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Root info
GET http://127.0.0.1:8100/
Accept: application/json

###

### Admin Dashboard (HTML)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8100/admin

###

# ─── Providers ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List providers
GET http://127.0.0.1:8100/api/admin/providers
Accept: application/json

###

### Create OpenAI provider
POST http://127.0.0.1:8100/api/admin/providers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "openai-main",
  "name": "OpenAI Production",
  "provider_type": "openai",
  "api_key_env_var": "OPENAI_API_KEY",
  "rate_limit_rpm": 500
}

###

# ─── Tenants ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List tenants
GET http://127.0.0.1:8100/api/admin/tenants
Accept: application/json

###

### Create bus tenant
POST http://127.0.0.1:8100/api/admin/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "bus",
  "name": "Đặt Vé Xe Bus",
  "description": "AI Agent hỗ trợ tìm kiếm và đặt vé xe bus",
  "grpc_target": "localhost:50052",
  "qdrant_prefix": "bus"
}

###

# ─── Task Types ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List available BPMN task types
GET http://127.0.0.1:8100/api/admin/task-types
Accept: application/json

###

# ─── Chat (REST) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Chat — search trips
POST http://127.0.0.1:8100/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_slug": "bus",
  "message": "Tìm chuyến xe từ Hà Nội đi Đà Nẵng ngày mai"
}

###

### Chat — check booking
POST http://127.0.0.1:8100/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_slug": "bus",
  "message": "Kiểm tra vé BK-ABC123"
}

###

### Chat — FAQ
POST http://127.0.0.1:8100/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_slug": "bus",
  "message": "Chính sách hoàn vé như thế nào?"
}

###

# ─── Reload ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Reload all registries
POST http://127.0.0.1:8100/api/admin/reload
Accept: application/json

###

### Reload specific tenant
POST http://127.0.0.1:8100/api/admin/reload/bus
Accept: application/json

###

# ─── Seed (run once to bootstrap bus tenant) ────────────────────────────────
# Run from terminal: cd aiservice && python -m src.seed
